Session Date	Editable?
2 days before	✅ Yes
1 day before	✅ Yes
Session day	✅ Yes
1 day after	✅ Yes
2 days after	✅ Yes
More than 2 days before	❌ No
More than 2 days after	❌ No

For example, if the session date is 5 June:

* 3 June → ✅ Edit allowed
* 4 June → ✅ Edit allowed
* 5 June → ✅ Edit allowed
* 6 June → ✅ Edit allowed
* 7 June → ✅ Edit allowed
* 2 June or earlier → ❌ Not allowed
* 8 June or later → ❌ Not allowed

The logic would be:

DateTime today = DateTime.Today;
DateTime sessionDate = session.SessionDate.Date;
int daysDifference = (today - sessionDate).Days;
bool canEdit = daysDifference >= -2 && daysDifference <= 2;

Or more simply:

bool canEdit = Math.Abs((today - sessionDate).Days) <= 2;

This allows editing from 2 days before to 2 days after the session date, and blocks editing outside that range.

